le value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September ran 39% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December ran 63%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 25692 got just 47% of normal that year.</p>"}
